artifacts:
  - $route/1.2.intake.structure.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-complete-timeline
      say: |
        is every event from the capture on the timeline, in temporal order?
        an event dropped here is a scenario missed downstream.
    - slug: has-exposures-and-effects-split
      say: |
        are exposures (cause:exposure) and effects (effect:symptom) itemized
        as separate sets, per define.causal-chain-frame? do not conflate them.
    - slug: has-dose-detail
      say: |
        for each exposure, is dose/quantity/route captured where stated?
        a dose omitted here cannot be flagged as above-label later.
